    {
      "name": "Twists and Turns",
      "type": "feature",
      "system": {
        "featureForm": "passive",
        "description": "<p>Countdown (6). When the party enters the dungeon, activate the countdown. It ticks down when a PC succeeds on an action roll to navigate the passages. When it triggers, the PCs reach the deepest, darkest, best-defended part of the dungeon.</p><section id=\"secret-U1QJ76Mn90bhcq6y\" class=\"secret\"><p>What reward lies at the heart of the maze? Who built this labyrinth to protect it?</p></section>",
