    {
      "name": "Deep Pockets",
      "type": "feature",
      "system": {
        "featureForm": "passive",
        "description": "<p>Once per rest, the PCs can find a cache of treasure inside the dungeon, either on the corpses of previous delvers or behind hidden doors. On a successful roll to navigate the dungeon, a PC can spend up to 5 Hope to roll that number of <strong>[[/r d6]]{d6s}</strong>. Each result rolled gains the party the following loot or equipment:</p><ol><li><p>Loose gemstones, jewelry, baubles, or coins equal to a handful of gold</p></li><li><p>A common item or consumable</p></li><li><p>An uncommon item or consumable</p></li><li><p>A rare item or consumable</p></li><li><p>A legendary item or consumable</p></li><li><p>A weapon or an armor from the party's tier</p></li></ol><section id=\"secret-pijQnwy6NtYYhveZ\" class=\"secret\"><p>What were the previous owners like? How do the PCs plan to get their purloined items out of the dungeon?</p></section>",
        "attribution": {},
        "gmNotes": "",
        "resource": null,
        "actions": {},
        "granter": null
      },
      "_id": "Y8BCsSqUBRNVycHf",
      "img": "icons/commodities/currency/coins-leather-pouch-stone.webp",
      "effects": [],
      "folder": null,
      "sort": 0,
      "flags": {},
      "_stats": {
        "compendiumSource": null
      },
      "_key": "!actors.items!tQpntfbUjUjmXc3e.Y8BCsSqUBRNVycHf"
    },
    {
      "name": "Wandering Monster",
      "type": "feature",
      "system": {
        "featureForm": "reaction",
        "description": "<p>When the party enters a new area of the dungeon, you can <strong>spend a Fear</strong> to summon <strong>1d4</strong> adversaries at or below the party's tier within Far range and roll a <strong>[[/r d6]]</strong>. On a result of 1 or 2, the PCs notice warning signs and can prepare for the encounter; the first PC to make an action roll gains advantage on it. On a result of 3 or 4, the combat occurs as usual. On a result of 5 or 6, the adversaries get the drop on the PCs and immediately take the spotlight, and you gain a Fear.</p><section id=\"secret-mX9aXZNDuTk77Dln\" class=\"secret\"><p>How did these creatures come to be here? What were they doing when the PCs encountered them?</p></section>",
        "attribution": {},
        "gmNotes": "",
        "resource": null,
